# Procedural assets

When editing world meshes, items, flora, or terrain:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/monorepo-architecture/SKILL.md`,
   `.cursor/skills/procedural-asset-factory/SKILL.md` and
   `.cursor/skills/ghibli-toon-graphics/SKILL.md`.
2. Put builders in `packages/client-gfx` — never duplicate in mobile/desktop.
3. Apps only host `WorldRenderer.tsx` + shaders; import via `@hunger-arena/client-gfx`.
4. Classify every asset: 360° (shadows+outline) vs 2.5D flat (billboard, no shadows).
5. Register new kinds in `AssetRegistry.ts`; colors from `PALETTE` only.
